<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-excel-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">⚡</div>
<div>
<p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Anında Otomatik İndir</p>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">IBAN bildirimi bekleme yok</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-white/90 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 flex items-start gap-2.5">
<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-excel-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">🔓</div>
<div>
<p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Açık Kaynak &amp; Esnek</p>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Şifresiz, kolayca düzenlenebilir</p>
</div>
